<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Hosken says negotiations still in progress.</title>
<headline>Hosken says negotiations still in progress.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hosken Consolidated Investments Ltd said on Wednesday that talks are still in progress which, if successful, may affect the firm's share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
